        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have already seen how this ends. Every morning you read the sky &mdash; which of thirteen signs is up, and whether it is kind &mdash; and every round you bend somebody else's luck by a little: a Guide for an ally's roll, a Snarl for an enemy's. You cannot fight, and you do not need to.</p><p><strong>Key attribute</strong> Wisdom &middot; <strong>Hit Points</strong> 8 + Constitution modifier per level &middot; <strong>Stargazer DC</strong> your focus spells and class features, Wisdom-keyed</p>"
        },
